<title>SWITZERLAND: BADMINTON-SWISS OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BADMINTON-SWISS OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1997-03-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinal results</p>
<p>in the Swiss Open badminton championships on Saturday (prefix</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Men's singles</p>
<p>1-Poul-Erik Hoyer-Larsen (Denmark) beat 3/4-Sun Jun (China) 15-3</p>
<p>12-15 15-10</p>
<p>9/16-Dong Jiong (China) beat Peter Rasmussen (Denmark) 15-7 15-5</p>
<p>Women's singles</p>
<p>1-Camilla Martin (Denmark) beat 5/8-Lee Joo-hyun (South Korea)</p>
<p>11-0 7-11 11-5</p>
<p>2-Ye Zhaoying (China) beat 3/4-Susi Susanti (Indonesia) 5-11</p>
<p>11-3 11-3</p>
</text>
